  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At some point every game eventually dies or losses popularity and I have an idea that could bring in players and casual users world wide! To sum up this idea before I get into details  it I call this “New You” the game will be similar to vrchat where users can create avatars but however in this game there will 1 massive world users will be able to build communities/cities/government/any thing the community wants. this  world will have the mmorpg feel with the vrchat vibes users will be able to build there own house,stores and avatar shops there will be mini game portals that will allow players to earn money that is used to purchase anything ranging from plots of land to customizing your house and shops. The shop system will allow creators to sell their art for in game currency.the games attention grabber will be the vast open world with many amazing sites with public activities such as fishing, paragliding,camping ,hunting beast  and playing with virtual pets. To Further encourage players to play host competitions between nations to build big and glorious cities",
